{"shots": [{"badge": "DAY 1 · 7:12 AM", "loc": "Apartment", "scene": "wake", "vo": "You wake up, and every news channel has the same headline: last night, every man on Earth died. *Except one*."}, {"badge": "DAY 1 · 7:13 AM", "loc": "Kitchen", "scene": "clock", "vo": "The kitchen clock has stopped at *3:33*. The last man is *you*."}, {"badge": "RULE 1", "loc": "Apartment", "scene": "phone", "vo": "Everyone is looking for you. Some want to save you. Others want to study you. Rule one: *phone in the water*."}, {"badge": "RULE 2", "loc": "Apartment", "scene": "street", "vo": "Rule two: *never go out in daylight*. The city outside is silent, like after a snowfall."}, {"badge": "DAY 1 · 9:40 PM", "loc": "Apartment", "scene": "drone", "vo": "In the evening, a drone flies up to your window. It hovers. And looks *right at you*. You run."}, {"badge": "DAY 2 · 6:05 AM", "loc": "Street", "scene": "disguise", "vo": "Hood, scarf, someone else's jacket. But the street cameras aren't looking for clothes. They're looking for *the way you walk*."}, {"badge": "DAY 2 · 2:20 PM", "loc": "Hospital", "scene": "hospital", "vo": "At the hospital, a doctor named *Vera* hides you. She asks no questions. Only one: \"Did you see the sky that night?\""}, {"badge": "DAY 2 · 2:21 PM", "loc": "That night", "scene": "sky", "vo": "You did. At 3:33, the sky turned *green*, and every clock stopped."}, {"badge": "DAY 3 · 7:00 PM", "loc": "Hospital", "scene": "science", "vo": "Scientists all over the world want to know why *only you* survived."}, {"badge": "DAY 3 · 11:58 PM", "loc": "Hospital", "scene": "radio", "vo": "And that night, the radio says something impossible: *a second surviving man* has been found."}, {"badge": "", "loc": "", "scene": "end", "vo": "Would you *go to him*?"}], "meta": [{"dur": 7.289625, "phr": [[0, 0.7458333333333333, "You wake up,"], [0.9658333333333333, 3.4816666666666665, "and every news channel has the same headline:"], [3.7016666666666667, 4.469479166666667, "last night,